questions.description:
Given the Java code below, what is the output of `new Child().display()`?

```java
class Parent {
    int x = 10;
    void print() { System.out.print(x + " "); }
}
class Child extends Parent {
    int x = 20;
    void print() { System.out.print(x + " "); }
    void display() {
        Parent p = this;
        System.out.print(p.x + " ");
        p.print();
    }
}
```

What will be printed to the console when executing this JavaScript code?

```javascript
console.log(1);
setTimeout(() => console.log(2), 0);
Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log(3)).then(() => console.log(4));
console.log(5);
```
